# What this engine says, case by case, for enus.
#
# Every line was blessed by IBM's own binary: the whole
# differential suite was run for this language
# immediately before these were written, and every case
# matched. See docs/testing.md.
#
# Written by test/matrix.sh record. One line a case:
# the category, which case in it, the first sixteen hex of
# the samples' hash, the same of the reported answers', and
# the sentence.

